## ==============================================================================
##  PARANOIA TOR CONFIGURATION FILE (torrc) - v2.5.0
##  Optimized for Windows System-Wide Transparent Proxying & Anti-Leak Protection
## ==============================================================================

## Client SOCKS5 Proxy Listener
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050

## DNS Resolution over Tor (Prevents ISP DNS Leaks on UDP Port 53)
DNSPort 127.0.0.1:5353
AutomapHostsOnResolve 1
AutomapHostsSuffixes .exit,.onion
VirtualAddrNetworkIPv4 10.192.0.0/10

## Control Port for Circuit Management (Signal NEWNYM & Heartbeat Monitor)
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 0

## Privacy & Security Hardening
SafeLogging 1
TestSocks 1
WarnUnsafeSocks 1
ClientOnly 1
HardwareAccel 1

## Circuit Lifecycle
MaxCircuitDirtiness 600
NewCircuitPeriod 30

## Preferred Exit Node Jurisdictions
## StrictNodes 1 (Force Tor to exclusively use the nodes specified below)
ExitNodes {ch},{is},{nl},{se},{no},{pa}
StrictNodes 0

## Logging & Runtime Cache
Log notice stdout
DataDirectory .\tor_data
